          "read": "2026-11-18",
          "note": "Full stamina is 42:00. Logged out, 1 minute is regained per 3 minutes, twice as long (6) for the bonus hours 39:00-42:00, and nothing is regained during the first 10 minutes after logout. 39:00 to 42:00 takes 18 hours and 10 minutes offline."
