          "kind": "calculator",
          "read": "2026-11-18",
          "note": "Capture research/calc-tests/stamina-exevopan-cases.json: 14:00 to 39:00 = 3 days 3 hours; 41:59 to 42:00 = 6 minutes; 0:00 to 10:00 = 1 day 6 hours; 38:00 to 40:00 = 9 hours; 0:00 to 42:00 = 5 days 15 hours (regeneration only, without the 10-minute logout delay)."
